meta {
  name: Update me
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/users/me
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "work_number": "021234567",
    "private_number": "0812345678"
  }
}

docs {
  User login (cookie Authentication_User): run "User auth / Login" first. Any user field but `username`. Only at request status 0, 1 or 6; at any other status, or with no status history, 403 "personal data can be edited only at request status 0, 1 or 6" and nothing changes. After the card is issued, change details with "Card request / New card request".
}
